<aetgt:getResponse xmlns:aetgt="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/repository/2010/10/avrepository.xsd"
                   xmlns:types1="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/repository/2010/10/avrepository.xsd">
   <types1:Item>
      <types1:EntryId>ugYTHbESlUs3xY4PcfoFaW-gt-00000004-2026-07-27T17:44:00.000Z::pd.xml</types1:EntryId>
      <types1:Name>CreatePersonAndContract_Process</types1:Name>
      <types1:MimeType>application/xml+process</types1:MimeType>
      <types1:Description>Build guide 4.8. New-hire path: creates the CPD person, then the contract.</types1:Description>
      <types1:AppliesTo/>
      <types1:Tags/>
      <types1:VersionLabel>1.0</types1:VersionLabel>
      <types1:State>CURRENT</types1:State>
      <types1:ProcessGroup/>
      <types1:CreatedBy>abdul.mannuru@hubbard.com.dev</types1:CreatedBy>
      <types1:CreationDate>2026-07-27T17:44:00Z</types1:CreationDate>
      <types1:ModifiedBy/>
      <types1:PublicationStatus>unpublished</types1:PublicationStatus>
      <types1:Entry>
         <process xmlns="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2010/10/avosScreenflow.xsd"
                  xmlns:tfm="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2021/04/taskflowModel.xsd"
                  xmlns:list="urn:activevos:spi:list:functions"
                  GUID="ugYTHbESlUs3xY4PcfoFaW"
                  displayName="CreatePersonAndContract_Process"
                  name="CreatePersonAndContract_Process"
                  overrideAPIName="false">
            <parameterSet xmlns="http://schemas.active-endpoints.com/appmodules/screenflow/2021/04/taskflowModel.xsd">
               <parameter name="Employee" direction="in" type="string" description="Base employee fields from GetEmployeeDetail_Process"/>
               <parameter name="WorkContracts" direction="in" type="string" isList="true" description="Employee.WorkContracts.Items from GetEmployeeDetail_Process"/>
               <parameter name="cpd_token" direction="in" type="string" description="CPD bearer token"/>
               <parameter name="NewPersonVinciId" direction="out" type="string" description="VINCI ID generated by CPD Create Person - required by the Orchestrator for the WriteVinciId_Process branch"/>
               <parameter name="NewContractId" direction="out" type="string" description="Contract id used/returned on the Create Contract call"/>
            </parameterSet>
            <appliesTo/>
            <description>Scenario 1 (New Hire / Create) per the functional design: CPD API 3.2.2 (Create Person) then 3.2.4 (Create/Update Contract). Invoked by the Orchestrator only when SearchPerson_Process.PersonFound = false (build guide 4.7, 4.8, 4.15 step 4).</description>
            <tags/>
            <generator>Informatica Process Designer 11</generator>
            <notes>Hand-authored against the CPD-Dayforce Functional Design &amp; API Build Guide v1.0 - see README_IICS_BUILD_NOTES.md for schema caveats.
OPEN ITEMS carried from the design doc (unresolved there too, not introduced by this build):
1) resolved_COR_ouId - mapping Dayforce HomeOrganization (LedgerCode/XRefCode) to a CPD organizationalUnitAssignment.ouId requires a client-supplied cross-reference table. dp-mapOrg below is a placeholder passthrough of the Dayforce org code and MUST be replaced with a real lookup (e.g. an IICS Lookup step against a client-provided CSV/table) before this can create a valid contract.
2) mapped_language_code - takes the first two characters of Employee.Culture.XRefCode (e.g. "en-US" -&gt; "en") as a best-effort default; confirm the full Dayforce-culture-to-CPD-language-ISO-code mapping table with the client.
3) NewContractId on the Create path - the design doc's Create/Update Contract call is a single PATCH to .../contracts/{contractId}, which presupposes a contractId. This process assumes CPD auto-issues a default contract id on Create Person and that it comes back on the CreatePerson response (contractId placeholder below) - confirm this against a live CPD test call; if not, this step needs a distinct Create Contract (POST) call instead, which is not currently documented.</notes>
            <deployment skipIfRunning="false" suspendOnFault="false" tracingLevel="none">
               <rest/>
            </deployment>
            <extData>
               <nvpair name="treatEmptyStringAsNotNull">false</nvpair>
               <nvpair name="treatEmptyObjectListAsArray">true</nvpair>
            </extData>
            <flow id="f4-create">
               <start id="start-create">
                  <link id="l1" targetId="dp-mapCreateFields"/>
               </start>
               <dataProcess id="dp-mapCreateFields" title="Map Dayforce fields to CPD Create Person fields">
                  <expression target="PreferredFirstName_or_FirstName">iif(isNull(Employee.PreferredFirstName) or Employee.PreferredFirstName = '', Employee.FirstName, Employee.PreferredFirstName)</expression>
                  <expression target="PreferredLastName_or_LastName">iif(isNull(Employee.PreferredLastName) or Employee.PreferredLastName = '', Employee.LastName, Employee.PreferredLastName)</expression>
                  <expression target="mapped_language_code">substring(Employee.Culture.XRefCode, 1, 2)</expression>
                  <link id="l2" targetId="inv-createPerson"/>
               </dataProcess>
               <invoke id="inv-createPerson" connector="cnctr_cpd_get" action="CreatePerson" title="Create CPD person">
                  <inputMapping>
                     <map source="Employee.EmployeeNumber" target="EmployeeNumber"/>
                     <map source="Employee.LastName" target="LastName"/>
                     <map source="Employee.FirstName" target="FirstName"/>
                     <map source="PreferredLastName_or_LastName" target="PreferredLastName_or_LastName"/>
                     <map source="PreferredFirstName_or_FirstName" target="PreferredFirstName_or_FirstName"/>
                     <map source="Employee.BirthDate" target="BirthDate"/>
                     <map source="Employee.SeniorityDate" target="SeniorityDate"/>
                     <map source="mapped_language_code" target="mapped_language_code"/>
                     <map source="cpd_token" target="cpd_token"/>
                  </inputMapping>
                  <outputMapping>
                     <map source="personVinciId" target="NewPersonVinciId"/>
                     <map source="response" target="rawCreatePersonResponse"/>
                  </outputMapping>
                  <link id="l3" targetId="dp-mapOrg"/>
               </invoke>
               <dataProcess id="dp-mapOrg" title="Resolve org unit / contract fields (PLACEHOLDER - see Open Item 1)">
                  <expression target="resolved_COR_ouId">Employee.HomeOrganization.LedgerCode</expression>
                  <expression target="NewContractId">iif(isNull(rawCreatePersonResponse.contractId), 'TBD_DEFAULT_CONTRACT_ID', rawCreatePersonResponse.contractId)</expression>
                  <link id="l4" targetId="inv-createContract"/>
               </dataProcess>
               <invoke id="inv-createContract" connector="cnctr_cpd_get" action="CreateOrUpdateContract" title="Create CPD contract">
                  <inputMapping>
                     <map source="NewPersonVinciId" target="personVinciId"/>
                     <map source="NewContractId" target="contractId"/>
                     <map source="list:first(WorkContracts, 'isActive = true').startDate" target="HireDate"/>
                     <map source="list:first(WorkContracts, 'isActive = true').endDate" target="EmploymentStatus_EffectiveTo"/>
                     <map source="resolved_COR_ouId" target="resolved_COR_ouId"/>
                     <map source="list:first(WorkContracts, 'isActive = true').operationalJobTitle" target="Job"/>
                     <map source="Employee.HomeOrganization.LedgerCode" target="Primary_Work_Assignment_Ledger_Code"/>
                     <map source="cpd_token" target="cpd_token"/>
                  </inputMapping>
                  <link id="l5" targetId="end-create"/>
               </invoke>
               <end id="end-create">
                  <title>End</title>
               </end>
            </flow>
         </process>
      </types1:Entry>
      <types1:GUID>ugYTHbESlUs3xY4PcfoFaW</types1:GUID>
      <types1:DisplayName>CreatePersonAndContract_Process</types1:DisplayName>
   </types1:Item>
   <types1:CurrentServerDateTime>2026-07-27T17:46:15.000Z</types1:CurrentServerDateTime>
</aetgt:getResponse>
